    "evidence_text": "Kim Ryeowook discography\n\nHenry Lau\n\n He debuted in 2008 as a member of Super Junior-M.\n\n He dubbed his fans as his Strings.\n\nCho Kyu-hyun discography\n\nCho Kyuhyun\n\n He is one of the first four Korean artists to appear on Chinese postage stamps.\n\nLee Sung-min (singer)\n\nLee Sung-min (born January 1, 1986) is a South Korean singer and actor.\n\nFinal Recipe\n\nFinal Recipe is a 2013 South Korean-Thai drama film directed by Gina Kim and written by George Huang, who adapted a story by Kim.\n\n It stars Michelle Yeoh, Henry Lau, and Chin Han.\n\n It premiered at the San Sebasti\u00e1n International Film Festival.\n\nEunhyuk\n\n He is a member of the South Korean boy group Super Junior and their subgroups, Super Junior-T and Super Junior-H.\n\nSuper Show\n\nThe Super Show was the first Asia-wide live concert tour by South Korean boy band, Super Junior.\n\n The tour kicked off with three stops in South Korea and expanded its routes to Thailand and China.\n\nLee Donghae\n\nKim Ryeowook",
